Source: pgwasm
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), cargo, clang
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/jnicholls/pgwasm

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pgwasm
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pgwasm
Depends: postgresql-PGVERSION, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: WebAssembly component runtime for PostgreSQL
 pgwasm runs WebAssembly components inside PostgreSQL and exposes their exports
 as strongly typed SQL functions. It uses Wasmtime's component model and keeps
 WASI capabilities disabled unless a database administrator enables them.
